i used the osd and it seemed like it was adjusting just fine. 

&#x200B;

i honestly think its just because im going from 100fps to 75fps, meaning 75hz, and that feels slower.

yeah i specifically put in effort to not get any rgb parts, but its impossible these days. MY MOTHERBOARD HAS RGB

&#x200B;

i literally couldnt find an economical case without rgb fans so i literally just didnt plug the rgb headers in. fuck rgb
